OL,3,GNEWSAIslanders fight for return of late
OL,4,Anight ferry sailing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders on Jura are fighting for the
OL,7,Frestoration of their late ferry
OL,8,Fservice.
OL,10,FArgyll and Bute Council withdrew its
OL,11,F21:30 service, between Port Askaig on
OL,12,FIslay to Feolin on Jura, in July. The
OL,13,Flast ferry now leaves at 18:30.
OL,15,FIslanders said the five-minute sailing
OL,16,Fwas hugely important to children
OL,17,Fattending after-school clubs on Islay,
OL,18,Fand to people making their way home
OL,19,Ffrom appointments on the mainland.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
